    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/3a118c67526f31bf12724396454fe85e.avif?t=1755441380\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd52 <i><strong>Pickle Panic!</strong></i><strong> \u2013 A Jar Full of Chaos</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Keep your balance, don\u2019t crack the jar, don\u2019t drop the pickle.</strong></i><br><i>In this physics-based co-op adventure, up to 4 pickles are trapped in a single fragile jar, trying to reach the goal without shattering their only ride.</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uded9 <i><strong>One Jar. One Goal. Don\u2019t Break It.</strong></i><br><i>The jar is your lifeline. Every fall, every bump weakens it. Make one wrong move and it all shatters \u2014 no second chances here.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <i><strong>1 to 4 Players \u2013 Solo or Local Co-Op</strong></i><br><i>Play alone or with up to 3 friends.  \u2014 the more pickles, the more chaotic the journey.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Physics-Based Mayhem</strong><br>Pickles don\u2019t bump into each other, but their combined forces move the jar. Every tiny movement affects the whole system \u2014 teamwork is crucial!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc94 <i><strong>When the Jar Breaks, It's Over</strong></i><br><i>The jar has a limit. Take too many hits, and it\u2019s game over. Fall with it, and you restart from scratch.</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf89 <strong>Why Play?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pickle Panic! is pure, unscripted chaos designed for couch co-op fans and lovers of absurd fun.</i><br><i>Every run is a laugh riot \u2014 especially if you're brave enough to try with four pickles.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Jump in the jar, hold your breath... and don\u2019t. let. it. break.</strong></i></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726940/extras/3a118c67526f31bf12724396454fe85e.avif?t=1755441380\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd52 <i><strong>Pickle Panic!</strong></i><strong> \u2013 A Jar Full of Chaos</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Keep your balance, don\u2019t crack the jar, don\u2019t drop the pickle.</strong></i><br><i>In this physics-based co-op adventure, up to 4 pickles are trapped in a single fragile jar, trying to reach the goal without shattering their only ride.</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uded9 <i><strong>One Jar. One Goal. Don\u2019t Break It.</strong></i><br><i>The jar is your lifeline. Every fall, every bump weakens it. Make one wrong move and it all shatters \u2014 no second chances here.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <i><strong>1 to 4 Players \u2013 Solo or Local Co-Op</strong></i><br><i>Play alone or with up to 3 friends.  \u2014 the more pickles, the more chaotic the journey.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Physics-Based Mayhem</strong><br>Pickles don\u2019t bump into each other, but their combined forces move the jar. Every tiny movement affects the whole system \u2014 teamwork is crucial!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc94 <i><strong>When the Jar Breaks, It's Over</strong></i><br><i>The jar has a limit. Take too many hits, and it\u2019s game over. Fall with it, and you restart from scratch.</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf89 <strong>Why Play?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pickle Panic! is pure, unscripted chaos designed for couch co-op fans and lovers of absurd fun.</i><br><i>Every run is a laugh riot \u2014 especially if you're brave enough to try with four pickles.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Jump in the jar, hold your breath... and don\u2019t. let. it. break.</strong></i></p></li></ul>",
